From dcc7dda40d702dbd6f68430d9a66b6f6c7a40612 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shandongtlb <40312509+shandongtlb@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 15:09:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 02/22] sched: restore built-in HMBIRD integration on current
 common

Invert the scheduler replacement hunks from c7bef25 while preserving current dmabuf, rseq, dtask and upstream fixes. Retain inactive ext source/tools. Targeted ARM64 object compilation passed with the supplied stock config; this restores the older official baseline, not complete current stock semantics.
